{"t":"Water Vortex","s":"water-vortex-7111c","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Water_Vortex_ef0bfa.gif","q":11,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Water Vortex</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Water Vortex\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_Vortex_ef0bfa.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150513105612&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_Vortex_ef0bfa.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a water vortex.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It draws you nearer.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Island\">Gray Island</a>, below <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>, east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Factory%20Quarter\">Factory Quarter</a> (inaccessible).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>If you just walk on it you are teleported to another place.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Maelstrom\">Maelstrom</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Channel\">Water Channel</a>.\n</p><p>If you step in the one east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a>, you will receive the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Spectulation\">Spectulation</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-pirates-death-to-me\">A Pirate's Death to Me</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/cults-of-tibia-quest\">Cults of Tibia Quest</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/liquid-black-quest\">Liquid Black Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Maelstrom\">Maelstrom</a></li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/podzilla-quest\">Podzilla Quest</a></li><li>Swimming</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-cursed-crystal-quest\">The Cursed Crystal Quest</a></li><li>Vortex</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Channel\">Water Channel</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["a-pirates-death-to-me","cults-of-tibia-quest","deeplings-world-change","hive-born-world-change","liquid-black-quest","opticording-sphere-quest","podzilla-quest","rootwalker-outfits-quest","the-cursed-crystal-quest","the-secret-library-quest","war-against-the-hive-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"a-pirates-death-to-me","quest":"A Pirate's Death to Me","step":"5-2","n":16,"title":"Evitar os pisos proibidos","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"cults-of-tibia-quest","quest":"Cults of Tibia Quest","step":"2-0","n":24,"title":"Descer no Outlaw Camp","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32637,"y":32266,"z":7,"label":"Escadas no Outlaw Camp"},{"x":32643,"y":32222,"z":7,"label":"Outlaw Camp"}]},{"slug":"cults-of-tibia-quest","quest":"Cults of Tibia Quest","step":"2-10","n":34,"title":"Sair do Misguided Camp","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"deeplings-world-change","quest":"Deeplings World Change","step":"1-0","n":3,"title":"Chegar a Fiehonja","kind":"mention","coords":[